  "post_content": "<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16.899999618530273px; text-align: justify;\"><gowgcx><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La tarde de este viernes se ha inagurado en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda la exposici&oacute;n de las <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=46491\" target=\"_blank\">mejores im&aacute;genes del XXI Concurso Nacional de fotograf&iacute;a de L&#39;Art de la Llum</a>. La muestra estar&aacute; abierta hasta el 1 de junio.</span></span></gowgcx></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1507.jpg\" alt=\"img_1507\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1508.jpg\" alt=\"img_1508\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1509.jpg\" alt=\"img_1509\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1510.jpg\" alt=\"img_1510\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1511.jpg\" alt=\"img_1511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1512.jpg\" alt=\"img_1512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1513.jpg\" alt=\"img_1513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoartllum14/img_1514.jpg\" alt=\"img_1514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543